    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "The expected (and observed) numbers of the four blood-type phenotypes are therefore: $$ \\begin{aligned}A:&\\quad[(0.2593)^{2}+2\\times0.2593\\times0.6755]\\times6313=2636.0\\quad(observed\\ 2625)\\end{aligned} $$ $$ \\begin{aligned}B:&\\quad[(0.0652)^{2}+2\\times0.0652\\times0.6755]\\times6313=582.9\\end{aligned} $$ $$ \\mathrm{O}:\\quad[(0.6755)^{2}\\times6313]=2880.6 $$",
      "source_page": 83,
